    "description": "The UCI Gravel World Series is the qualifying circuit for the UCI Gravel World Championships. Rounds in the 2027 season qualify age-group riders for the 2027 Worlds in Châtel, Haute-Savoie, France, provisionally set for August 26-27, 2027. Six qualifiers are on the published 2027 calendar, from Leuven in October 2026 to Marathon in Greece in November; Gravel Chile is postponed.",
    "history": "The UCI launched the series in 2022. Panaracer's GravelKing brand holds the title sponsorship from 2026 through 2028. The 2026 season ran 45 rounds in 31 countries before the World Championships in Nannup, Western Australia, on October 10-11, 2026.",
